    <title>Azure/azure-sdk-for-net - Releases - 2026-10-23</title>
    <id>https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net#2026-10-23</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net" />
    <updated>2026-10-24T00:09:12Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.ResourceManager.EdgeActions_1.0.0-beta.4"&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.EdgeActions_1.0.0-beta.4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.0.0-beta.4 (2026-10-22)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated the default service API version from &lt;code&gt;2025-12-01-preview&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;2026-10-01&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Breaking Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;EdgeActionVersionResource.DeployVersionCode&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;DeployVersionCodeAsync&lt;/code&gt; now return operations with an &lt;code&gt;EdgeActionVersionResource&lt;/code&gt; result instead of &lt;code&gt;EdgeActionVersionProperties&lt;/code&gt;. Access the deployed version's properties through &lt;code&gt;operation.Value.Data.Properties&lt;/code&gt; instead of &lt;code&gt;operation.Value&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clarified documentation for PATCH tag replacement and clearing, rejected SKU updates, version deployment-type restrictions, and default-version changes through &lt;code&gt;SwapDefault&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.ResourceManager.Hci_1.4.0"&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.Hci_1.4.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.4.0 (2026-10-22)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upgraded API version to &lt;code&gt;2026-10-01&lt;/code&gt; (stable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added support for cluster jobs and edge-machine management, including deployment settings, disks, network adapters, security settings, volumes, and associated job operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
            </content>
  </entry>
